# Testing

- High unit-test coverage is required; add or extend tests with every change.
- Cover edge cases and failure paths, not just the happy path.
- Mock external services (Yahoo, MLB, Azure OpenAI); never hit live APIs in unit tests.
- Do NOT lower or skip the coverage gate to make CI pass.
